          "@id": "jemc:mbs-2022-01-01-er-eligibility",
          "urpx:name": "Eligibility for Schedule MBS Market Based Service",
          "urpx:description": "To customers over 900 kW connected demand taking delivery at a standard voltage at a single point of delivery. Availability is determined case by case at the Cooperative's sole discretion.",
